homelab-grafana (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: Grafana provisioning for the fleet monitoring host.
    Ships a Prometheus datasource (local homelab-prometheus :9090, set
    default) and a file dashboard provider loading JSON dashboards from
    /etc/grafana/dashboards/homelab -- starting with "Fleet Host Health"
    (per-host CPU/memory/root-disk/load from node_exporter, plus fleet
    roll-up stats). Depends on the upstream grafana package (staged
    separately; not in the Ubuntu archive). Advertises itself into the
    fleet topology (kind: metrics-ui). Grafana auth stays at its default
    here; SSO gating + the accountmanage embed land in a later phase.

 -- Jeff Gardner <mailmasker-api01@forge.name>  Tue, 30 Sep 2026 14:30:00 -0500
